==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep (Enemy Base)|Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep]].
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Enmu]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since the special base is vulnerable to [[Explosion]]s, a [[Rich Cat]] and at least 1500 worth of Starting money combos allows [[Talents|Talented]] [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to kill the base before anything spawns at all. However, even if not doing this the boss remains very vulnerable to being rushed down like normal; other quick attackers like [[Fishman Cat]] and [[Can Can Cat]] both exploit this weakness and help to obtain the [[Timed Stage Reward]]s.

